.locks/

# Release packages and the DEMO signing material (06_packaging_spec §2.2, §4.1; step 100).
# `/release/` is anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `release/` would also ignore the
# packager sources in scripts/release/ (step 95).
/release/
apps/mobile/signing/

# Project-local PostgreSQL (backend task 2026-10-04, plan W03 / W07; SR-60, AC-B-64):
# the cluster, the server log and the three credential files. Never version them.
# `/.data/` is anchored to the repo root, like `/release/` above.
/.data/

# Test runner output (vitest JSON reporter); generated, never versioned.
.vitest/

# Backend task 2026-10-04 (plan W103, D227, D257): frame dumps stay on disk, never versioned.
docs/**/rec/*_frames/

# Evidence logs enter the commit after a count-only secret scan (D257). `*.log` above stays the
# default; only `assets/*.log` of the docs tree is re-included. Scan hits stay out, by name.
!docs/**/assets/*.log
docs/2026-10-04_dems_backend_rbac_pairing/implementation/assets/31_live_testing_tests_verbose.log
docs/2026-10-04_dems_backend_rbac_pairing/implementation/assets/12d_cpc1_red_before.log

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Real capture task 2026-10-07 (blueprint row 97): key material, model weights and recorded
# media by EXTENSION. They are already kept out by WHERE they are written (`/.data/`, `.cache/`);
# these patterns hold when one is written anywhere else. Each group re-includes exactly the
# folders whose files of that kind are versioned on purpose (the synthetic demo assets, the
# public device certificates of the version-1 demo packages, the screen recordings in the
# predecessor task's docs). Check after a change: `git ls-files -ci --exclude-standard` prints
# nothing (no tracked file is ignored).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Key and certificate material (`*.key`, `*.p12`, `*.pfx`, `*.jks`, `*.keystore` are above).
*.pem
!packages/shared/assets/demo-evidence/**/device-certificate.pem
# The forms the evidence signer and the credential store write (security review S99-07, batch N):
# a private key (`*.p8`), a wrapped key (`*.wrap`) and a sealed blob (`*.blob`). They are written
# under `/.data/`, which is ignored as a place; this ignores them by FORM too, so that a key
# directory chosen inside the repository (`evidence:dev-key --data-dir <dir>`) is not one
# `git add -A` from a commit. No tracked file has one of these extensions.
*.p8
*.wrap
*.blob

# Model weights. `*.bin` only under a model folder or by the ggml file name: a fixture named
# `*.bin` elsewhere stays visible to git.
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.safetensors
ggml-*.bin
**/models/**/*.bin

# Recorded and encoded media.
*.mp4
*.m4a
*.m4s
*.mkv
*.mka
*.mov
*.webm
*.wav
*.flac
*.aac
*.mp3
*.pcm
!packages/shared/assets/demo-media/**
!packages/shared/assets/demo-evidence/**/media/**
!apps/mobile/assets/media/**
!docs/2026-10-04_dems_backend_rbac_pairing/**/*.mp4
